{"ticker":{"symbol":"012205.KS","name":"계양전기우","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4230.0,"change_pct":-0.030927835051546393,"market_cap":125434642432.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":26900.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Tools & Accessories","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":638,"website":"https://www.keyang.com","business_summary":"Keyang Electric Machinery Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells power tools in Korea and internationally. It offers power tools, including cordless drills, grinders, hammer drills, drills, cutting tools, impact wrenches, sander/polishers/trimmers, related batteries, and other tools. The company also provides automotive products, such as power seating motors, steering column motors, electric parking brakes, powertrains, and other related products. In addition, it provides e-Mobility solutions and motor+speed reducers for actuators, as well as electric scooters under the Scooty name. Keyang Electric Machinery Co., Ltd. was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"계양기전(주)는 국내외 전동공구를 제조, 판매하고 있습니다. 무선 드릴, 그라인더, 해머 드릴, 드릴, 절삭 공구, 임팩트 렌치, 샌더/연마기/트리머, 관련 배터리 및 기타 도구를 포함한 전동 공구를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 파워 시트 모터, 스티어링 칼럼 모터, 전자 주차 브레이크, 파워트레인 및 기타 관련 제품과 같은 자동차 제품도 제공합니다. 또한 Scooty라는 이름으로 전기 스쿠터뿐만 아니라 액추에이터용 e-Mobility 솔루션과 모터+감속기도 제공합니다. 계양전기기계주식회사는 1977년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"공구","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":365075103180.0,"operating_income":-10631134080.0,"net_income":-24539071240.0,"eps":-860.473576},{"period":"2023","revenue":381634129990.0,"operating_income":-3894777710.0,"net_income":-1264724490.0,"eps":-42.940859},{"period":"2024","revenue":369125242680.0,"operating_income":-15260823880.0,"net_income":-6122310